{"version":1,"width":1080,"height":1350,"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"loveke-size\" content=\"1080x1350\">\n<title>Liefde op het eerste zicht</title>\n<style>/* Loveke Instagram-huisstijl. Lettertypes lokaal (fontsource), geen netwerk nodig. */\n@font-face{font-family:'Lilita One';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/lilita-one-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n:root{--cream:#FFF8F0;--black:#1A1A1A;--orange:#FF7033;--yellow:#FFD43D;--red:#E3404B;--pink:#FF85A1}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n.wm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3404B 0%,#FF7033 55%,#FFC93D 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.dots{background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,26,26,.10) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:22px 22px}\n/* Plek voor een Instagram-sticker (poll, link, vraag, aftelling): leeg in de export. */\n.slot{visibility:hidden}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"dots\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 1350px; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #FF7033; position: relative; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: #1A1A1A\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 70px; top: 52px; font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; font-size: 60px; color: #FFF8F0; transform: rotate(-2deg)\" data-slot=\"bovenregel\" data-label=\"Bovenregel\" data-max=\"42\">Bratislava, zomer 2024</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 70px; top: 160px; width: 500px; height: 820px; overflow: hidden; border: 6px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 14px 14px 0 #1A1A1A; background: #FFF; transform: rotate(-2.5deg)\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/src/assets/comic/strip-3.webp\" alt=\"Strippaneel: hij kijkt verliefd, met hartjes in een denkwolk\" style=\"position: absolute; width: 1736px; left: -1172px; top: -70px; max-width: none; display: block\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 615px; right: 40px; top: 190px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; line-height: 0.95; font-size: 94px; color: #1A1A1A\" data-slot=\"titel\" data-label=\"Titel\" data-max=\"20\">Drie seconden.</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 620px; right: 60px; top: 440px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; line-height: 1; font-size: 66px; color: #FFF8F0; -webkit-text-stroke: 3px #1A1A1A\" data-slot=\"subtitel\" data-label=\"Subtitel\" data-max=\"30\" data-multiline=\"true\">Meer had hij niet nodig.</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 590px; top: 830px; width: 440px; height: 312px; overflow: hidden; border: 6px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 #FFD43D; background: #FFF; transform: rotate(3deg)\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/src/assets/comic/strip-3.webp\" alt=\"Strippaneel: zij met rugzak en hij voor de deur van hetzelfde hostel\" style=\"position: absolute; width: 497px; left: -18px; top: -334px; max-width: none; display: block\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 80px; top: 1060px; width: 440px; font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.05; font-size: 64px; color: #1A1A1A; transform: rotate(-2deg)\" data-slot=\"onderregel\" data-label=\"Onderregel\" data-max=\"34\" data-multiline=\"true\">en ja: zelfde hostel. natuurlijk.</div>\n<div class=\"wm\" style=\"position: absolute; right: 70px; bottom: 50px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 64px; background: #1A1A1A; -webkit-background-clip: initial; background-clip: initial; color: #FFF8F0; padding: 4px 22px; border-radius: 16px\">Loveke</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}